summary.label:
This application is an additional material for learning English vocabulary and is designed for everyone who learns English on their own.

How well do you know the English words you have been learning? Test yourself with a game in which your task is to find an extra word. You are given four words in English, three of which have an associative relationship with each other (a common theme), and the fourth does not.

The rules are simple:

- Carefully read the list of words in English;
- Find something in common between the given words;
- Find a word that does not have a common feature for other English words;
- Click on the word that you think is superfluous;
- If the answer is correct, then the button with the selected word will turn green;
- After each completed round, you will see the number of correct and incorrect answers.

Educational games help to make the process of learning a foreign language interesting and exciting. We advise you to play the game as many times as necessary to practice the knowledge of the words of the English language.

Go ahead with us to practice vocabulary and learn English!

If you like the app, please leave us a review. It means a lot to us.
